{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12234220","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12234220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1223422001:1":{"text":"레나타, 이 망할 자식!","source_cn":"雷纳塔那混球！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EB528905EEDBA8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223422002:1":{"text":"사람이 안 다쳤으면 됐어. 얼른 가자.","source_cn":"人就没事就行，该走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x196E29C900FB2153","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223422003:1":{"text":"젠장... 젠장! 솔로가 이틀 밤을 꼬박 새워서 잡은 물고기가 전부 날아가 버리다니!","source_cn":"可恶……可恶！梭罗花了两天两夜抓的鱼，全炸飞了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x955FE09825ABE2FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223422004:0":{"text":"블러디 로즈에서 곧 올 거야. 아르, 얼른 도망쳐야 해!","source_cn":"血薇帮的人快到了，是时候跑路了！阿尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6789F26B785DF87A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223422005:1":{"text":"역시 물귀신파의 짓이었나! 전부 데려가!","source_cn":"果然是水鬼帮搞的鬼！全部带走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x815730774E17F293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223422006:1":{"text":"아니! 이건 전부 레나타 짓입니다. 우리와는 상관없어요!","source_cn":"不！这都是雷纳塔搞的鬼，跟我们没关系！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x835B3AC0E01C2A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223422007:1":{"text":"레나타라니. 온 항구 사람들이 너희 물귀신파가 생선 가게를 열었다는 걸 알고 있어. 이 화물차도 너희 것 아닌가?","source_cn":"什么雷纳塔，现在全港口的人都知道你们水鬼在开鱼铺，这货...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9CC9BCC03C3138F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1223422008:1":{"text":"생각을 좀 해보시죠! 제가 화물차를 가져다 터뜨렸다고요? 대체 뭘 위해서?","source_cn":"你动动脑子！我特意把车推过来炸的吗？我能有什么好处！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93A2BEFA52500CAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223422009:1":{"text":"시끄러워! 데려가서 루카에게 넘겨.","source_cn":"去和卢卡交代吧，少废话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74DC3D3587A4F836","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1223422009":{"text":"시끄러워! 데려가서 루카에게 넘겨.","source_cn":"去和卢卡交代吧，少废话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74DC3D3587A4F836","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1223422010:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님.